   "id": "hdr_sticky",
   "name": "HEADER",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "# NZAMY · Communication\n\n• **4.1** WhatsApp triage (`/whatsapp-incoming`) ✅ keyword classify (LLM optional later) → DUMMY reply\n• **4.2** Consultation reminder (cron 30min) ✅ Supabase getAll due → filter 24h → resolve → DUMMY → **mark reminder_sent**\n• **4.3** Hearing reminder ⬜ deferred — hearings live in service_requests.metadata (JSONB), no date column\n\nNeeds migration `20260706_reminder_flags.sql` (adds consultations.reminder_sent). Supabase cred `nzamy`.",
